Modifications made by the authors of this repository
----------------------------------------------------

1. `tokenizers/src/models/bpe/trainer.rs`
   Adds likelihood-based merge scoring to the bottom-up BPE trainer, selectable
   via `score_by`:
     * `count`             - standard BPE (most frequent pair); the paper's BPE
     * `greedy_ll_exact`   - exact change in corpus log-likelihood
     * `greedy_ll_approx`  - first-order approximation, n_bc * (PMI - 1)
   This is the paper's BottomUpLL tokeniser.

2. `tokenizers/src/models/unigram/compression_trainer.rs`
   New `CompressionTrainer`: top-down pruning that maximises compression rather
   than likelihood. This is the paper's TopDownComp tokeniser.

3. `tokenizers/src/models/unigram/trainer.rs`
   Adds an optional `seed_vocab` so training can start from a supplied
   vocabulary instead of the suffix-array seeding step (used for the
   SentencePiece-seeded ablation).

4. `bindings/python/src/trainers.rs`, `bindings/python/src/models.rs`
   Python bindings for the above, plus optional training telemetry.
